@startuml
!include ../../_common/style.puml

title L2：路由模型类图
left to right direction

package "API Model\napi.model" #E3F2FD {
  class MessageDestination
}

package "Routing\ncore.routing" #EDE7F6 {
  interface DestinationResolver
  class DefaultDestinationResolver
  class DestinationRouteRegistry
  class DestinationRoute
  enum DestinationRoutingMode
}

package "SPI\nmessage-spi" #ECEFF1 {
  class ProviderDestination
}

DefaultDestinationResolver ..|> DestinationResolver
DefaultDestinationResolver --> DestinationRouteRegistry
DestinationRouteRegistry --> DestinationRoute
DestinationRoute --> DestinationRoutingMode
DestinationRoute --> ProviderDestination
DestinationResolver --> MessageDestination
DestinationResolver --> ProviderDestination

note right of DestinationRoutingMode
STRICT：必须命中配置路由。
LENIENT：可使用 providerHint / name 兜底。
end note
@enduml
